Represent the matrix in a maintainable policy structure.

Do not scatter authorization rules throughout the codebase.

============================================================
10. SECURITY LEVEL ENFORCEMENT
============================================================

Implement security-level checks.

An actor must not access memory above their allowed
security level.

Use the existing canonical security levels.

Example conceptual rule:

